    "sentence": "To evaluate the sum: \\[\n\\sum_{k=2}^{\\infty} f(k) = \\sum_{k=2}^{\\infty} \\left( \\sum_{j=2}^{2008} \\frac{1}{j^k} \\right),\n\\]",
    "sentence-type": "answer",
